      {
        "id": "tb-index-position",
        "moduleId": "m-placement",
        "depth": "advanced",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "柱面索引应放在哪个柱面",
        "markdown": "每次检索都要先查柱面索引，磁头会在柱面之间移动，因此希望平均移动距离最小。设文件占有 $n$ 个柱面，柱面索引放在第 $x$ 个柱面上，则磁头移动距离的平均值为\n\n$$\n\\bar{s}=\\frac{1}{n}\\left[\\sum_{i=1}^{x}(x-i)+\\sum_{i=x+1}^{n}(i-x)\\right]=\\frac{1}{n}\\left[x^{2}-(n+1)x+\\frac{n(n+1)}{2}\\right]\n$$\n\n令 $\\frac{\\mathrm{d}\\bar{s}}{\\mathrm{d}x}=0$，得到 $x=\\frac{n+1}{2}$。也就是说，柱面索引应放在数据文件中间位置的柱面上。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-6ea5f19a3c614ba8cee7df46",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000335"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机精品学习资料大放送",
                "ISAM 文件"
              ],
              "lineStart": 10961,
